#import "@preview/abntly:0.1.1": *

= Conclusion <ch-conclusion>

This example gathered the elements of an academic work in the standards of the @abnt. The pre-textual and the
post-textual elements were created by the functions of the package, and the elements of the text were written with
the markup of Typst and with the functions `source`, `legend`, `note`, `frame`, `fitted`, `ibge-table` and
`no-indent`.

To start a new work, copy the main file of this example, replace the data of the work and write each chapter in a
file of the folder `chapters/`.
